@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:start with Resupply Cycle Triggered;
:check Inventory Level;
:v1: Inventory Level Condition ({at_or_below_minimum, Inventory Level is above the minimum}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'at_or_below_minimum'])
:Create Purchase Order;
:Reviewing the Purchase Order;
:v2: Purchase Order Status ({approved, rejected}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = 'approved'])
:Reserve funds for purchase;
:Send Order to Suppliers;
-> Simultaneously, complete the following steps;
split
:the Supplier sends a packing slip and an invoice;
:record packing slip;
split again
:Supplier sends invoice;
:record invoice;
end split
:Release reserved funds and issue payment to supplier;
:End process after payment is issued;
stop
else ([v2 = 'rejected'])
:Rework the order;
:review the Purchase Order again;
endif
else ([v1 = 'Inventory Level is above the minimum'])
:End process;
stop
endif
@enduml